1527
00:52:38,871 --> 00:52:40,741
I was on the tour for a whole year.

1528
00:52:41,141 --> 00:52:42,741
It ended at the end of last June.

1529
00:52:43,111 --> 00:52:45,150
Gosh. Did you tour around for a year?

1530
00:52:45,151 --> 00:52:46,751
Yes. The tour was a year long this time.

1531
00:52:47,011 --> 00:52:48,620
Especially for this year,

1532
00:52:48,621 --> 00:52:50,621
