You're right.

1924
01:06:09,881 --> 01:06:11,880
- They don't clap these days.
- Exactly.

1925
01:06:11,881 --> 01:06:12,990
- They don't clap.
- It feels awkward.

1926
01:06:12,991 --> 01:06:15,350
- No, they don't clap these days.
- They don't clap?

1927
01:06:15,351 --> 01:06:16,591
They don't.

1928
